OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with warm sunny spells for
OL,6,Fmost, although isolated showers may
OL,7,Fdevelop across the Pennines. The wind
OL,8,Fpicking up in the afternoon, before
OL,9,Feasing by the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mainly dry night with the
OL,12,Fchance of some rain in the north of
OL,13,Fthe region by the morning. Breezy at
OL,14,Ftimes especially along the coast.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FA cloudy day, with rain likely
OL,17,Fin north of the region. Drier in the
OL,18,Fsouth, with some sunny intervals,
OL,19,Fturning cloudy overnight with rain
OL,20,Fspreading across the region.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
